      "text": "encodings:\n\ncard_i[5:0]\n\n   Bit:       5       4       3       2       1       0\n          +-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+\n   Card:  |   Suit[1:0]   |          Rank[3:0]           |\n          +-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+\n               2 bits                 4 bits\n\ndeal_draw_mode\n\n0 : dealing\n1 : drawing\n\n",
